    "note": "Self-written for the keys lab: a candidate for his pick, read by no part yet.",
    "sparse": "liquid-space round 1: trimDb 3.2 -> 5.48 (+2.28 dB), the sparse-writing match the keys lab's round 3 left open: its level on the sparse writing (keys alone, the close grand, i9 to VImaj9, the mean of its three wetness steps) brought to the three very wet spaces' mean, -26.65 LUFS"
