    "adopted": "revision 2 (liquid-riffs-2, 10-08, notes/rounds/liquid-riffs-2.md): moved from the mined candidates into the liquid place's riff table, drawn by weight beside V's where the birds stand toward Tide, the calm. The pitch knots re-encoded in the loader's format since liquid-fix (each knot's note as an anchor, its offset as the residual: the same straight path, the register now chosen once); the phrase's knobs V's; the pair share 1 throughout where it read 0, so the riff plays V's body (the unequal pair, and the voice's third harmonic following it); the play block V's whole, its pairClock with it, as the place's way of playing a line. V's own rules stay V's: no afterKick, no double slides, no body accents, no press",
