    "round": "ambient-bells",
    "module": "perc.ts",
    "note": "A soft shaker, a swish and not a tick (his ear, 10-17: the record's shaker is the hat ladder's noise over 3.2 kHz, and in a sparse bell space it read as a hat): the cabasa's builder with its band well under the record's shaker (a highpass at 1 kHz and a wide band at 2.2 kHz), its two bursts 35 ms apart (the beads going and coming back, not a flam), a twelve-millisecond attack and an 80 ms fall, and a third of it to the room. Rendered alone in a conversation: its energy's mean frequency 3.0 kHz and 55 % of it over 2 kHz, where the record's shaker was 4.6 kHz and 85 %."
