   "vocabulary": {
    "says": "one vocabulary (PLAN-UNIFY §2.4): every ending and phrase event the arrangement plays, with where it leads (its destinations: the phrase map's functions, an answer's arrival) and what the kit must have (its needs: a lane that sounds). Where it plays: `house`, the house's small things (`treatment:<kind>`, the rows of `recipes/treatments/` at the rates of the place table's `SUBSECTIONS`, the house's own the defaults) or this row's own (`segment:`, `answer:`, `out`); `producer`, the fast places' ending names (`src/passage.ts` `End`, at the weights of `recipes/ambient/producer.json`). Every name of either side is in exactly one entry (tools/check-passage.ts holds it)",
