 "noise": {
  "says": "the gestures that are noise, with the direction each belongs to (his word: a seam 'from higher to lower or the other way'): a riser up into more; the sweep slot's voice a falling sweep, down into less; a whoosh, a reverse and a swell either way (a whoosh still needs the kick under it and never goes into a break, its row's own needs): U2d's rows by id, the house's glue rows by their slot",
