      "level": 0.65,
      "effect": "reverb",
      "params": {
        "mode": 2,
        "decaySeconds": 4.5,
        "predelayMs": 35,
        "lowCutHz": 350,
        "dampHz": 4400,
        "level": 2,
        "mix": 1
      }
    }
  ],
  "provenance": {
    "module": "effects/space.ts",
    "round": "liquid-keys",
    "note": "Self-written for the keys lab: a candidate for his pick, read by no part yet.",
    "sparse": "liquid-space round 1: trimDb 1.3 -> 1.55 (+0.25 dB), the sparse-writing match the keys lab's round 3 left open: its level on the sparse writing (keys alone, the close grand, i9 to VImaj9, the mean of its three wetness steps) brought to the three very wet spaces' mean, -26.65 LUFS"
