     "name": "Two ping-pong tape echoes, fed back long",
     "says": "A ping-pong tape echo at a dotted eighth, filtered 400 Hz to 2.6 kHz in its feedback with the head wandering, and a slower one at a dotted quarter, darker (450 Hz to 2 kHz) and wandering more: a phrase thrown into both writes a phrase of its own crossing the field. Notes are sent straight into each (`journey.echo`, `journey.dub`); nothing passes dry.",
     "dry": 0,
